WEBVTT

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
A blue sky before the end of the rainy season

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:13.580
Tsuyu ake mae no aozora wa...

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
makes a heart dance with expectation

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:21.500
hitoashi hayaku kokoro wo odoraseru

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Summer is coming yet again

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:28.980
Kotoshi mo mosugu natsuga kuru

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
The city and people are coming to life bursting with joy

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:37.410
Machi mo hito mo ukare kibun de zawameki dasu

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
A man who's grown up without losing his boyish heart

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:46.530
Shonen no kokoro no mama otona ni natta hito

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
We can't go back to the day we met for the first time, but...

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:55.260
Futari deatta anohi ni modorenai kedo...

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
If I close my eyes, I can see your smiling face

00:00:57.400 --> 00:01:05.000
Hitomi wo tojireba hohoemu kao ga mieru

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.880
The song we both loved. Do you still sing it?

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:12.910
Daisuki na ano uta. Ima mo utatte masuka?

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
I can still hear that gentle voice and melody

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:20.750
Watashi ni wa kikoeru. Yasashii koe to melody

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
During times of sadness, I will remember you

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:30.030
Yowaki na toki hodo anata wo omoidasu

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.600
The tsuchinoko really exists?

00:01:40.620 --> 00:01:42.430
Oh, maybe they do.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:43.190
Right?

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:43.880
Yeah.

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:46.620
You think so too, don't you?

00:01:46.910 --> 00:01:48.900
I don't think so.

00:01:48.990 --> 00:01:50.520
Well, I guess.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:51.790
Eh?

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:54.330
Excuse me...

00:01:55.120 --> 00:01:58.280
could you tell me where Seitow
Sannomiya Private School is?

00:02:01.670 --> 00:02:02.700
It's over there.

00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:10.050
Oh, thank you very much.

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.390
It's unusual for a man to come
to our school, isn't it?

00:02:18.980 --> 00:02:20.690
What does he need to go there for?

00:02:22.020 --> 00:02:22.620
Love...

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:30.090
7th Period
"Longed-For Complexion Toner"

00:02:32.320 --> 00:02:34.310
Ah, my prince.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:36.810
It doesn't look like him at all.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:39.640
No effort to make it
look like him, either.

00:02:40.440 --> 00:02:42.640
First of all,
what about your boyfriend?

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.520
That's different.

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:49.170
But I wonder what his business was.

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:51.380
He probably knows someone here.

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.290
Hibiki-sensei, for instance.

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:54.960
Hibiki-sensei?

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:56.930
Yeah, maybe a boyfriend.

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.420
No he isn't. He can't be!

00:03:00.170 --> 00:03:02.090
How do you know that?

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:03.670
But...

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:06.810
Yeah, Fuko's right.

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.900
He's too handsome for Sensei.

00:03:10.470 --> 00:03:13.150
Hibiki-sensei's personality will end up...

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:15.350
making it pretty hard to find a boyfriend, ...

00:03:15.950 --> 00:03:19.020
let alone win the heart
of such a cute guy.

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.350
That's just unthinkable.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.370
Right, Fu...

00:03:24.420 --> 00:03:25.950
Umeda!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:38.230
How can she make her dear
student do chores like this?

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.240
It's OK, Miho-chan.

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:43.150
She wasn't seriously upset.

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.440
You're such a sweet child.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:49.470
You're even helping me
without being asked, too.

00:03:50.760 --> 00:03:54.670
I'll be your big sister and make sure
you find happiness, OK?

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:56.680
Thanks, Miho-chan.

00:03:58.640 --> 00:03:59.500
What's wrong?

00:04:07.250 --> 00:04:10.610
Oh, Uncle, this is Hibiki-sensei?

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.460
What? Whose voice is that?

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.280
So, Yoshio...

00:04:16.570 --> 00:04:19.180
didn't I tell you she was beautiful?

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:24.280
Yes, I am very happy...

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.080
to have an omiai
with someone like her.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:29.270
Wait a moment, please!

00:04:29.690 --> 00:04:31.400
I have not agreed to...

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:35.430
Don't be shy, Hibiki-sensei.

00:04:35.530 --> 00:04:37.200
That's not what I mean!

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:39.010
I know how you must feel.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:41.800
You cannot
leave your dear students.

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:45.500
But you see, a woman's
happiness lies only in marriage.

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.430
Director, what do you mean by that?

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.480
Just as I said.

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:52.340
If there were male kyoshi here...

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.600
you would have probably met a man, but...

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:56.440
We do not need men here!

00:04:57.190 --> 00:05:00.290
At any rate, I haven't considered
omiai or marriage...

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.370
Amawa-sensei!

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:05.820
For Inu-nabe

00:05:07.960 --> 00:05:08.830
It's fine, isn't it?

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.580
Only as formal courtesy.

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:26.340
So he's a prospective arranged
marriage partner for Hibiki-sensei.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.630
I wasted my breath
saying he was cute.

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:31.330
This is absurd.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.350
What's wrong, Fuko?

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:37.120
Oh, nothing.

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:39.200
Oh, really?

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.030
But he is a good-looking man.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.710
This is upsetting!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:55.290
Gochiso

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.920
Humph, not my problem.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:00.990
Don't say that!

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:03.120
The miai is going to be tomorrow.

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:05.700
They say, "good deeds
should be done quickly."

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:08.990
Oh please, Ba-chan.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.610
I don't care how.
Just help me get out of this.

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:17.430
He's the Director's nephew,
that means he's pretty rich, right?

00:06:17.670 --> 00:06:19.000
I guess.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:23.430
So if you marry him, you'll be able
to pay up all the outstanding rent.

00:06:23.450 --> 00:06:24.580
That's good.

00:06:24.750 --> 00:06:25.620
I see.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.420
Hey, wait a minute!

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:30.160
If you want to complain,
pay up what you owe me first.

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:31.410
Until then, be happy.

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:33.110
Hey, wait!

00:06:36.810 --> 00:06:37.870
Damn...

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.320
Sensei, you're going
to have an omiai?

00:06:51.480 --> 00:06:53.960
What was that feeling I had earlier?

00:06:58.030 --> 00:06:59.210
What are you doing?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.940
Fukae-kun. You heard, didn't you?

00:07:03.050 --> 00:07:05.150
Hibiki-sensei is going
to have an omiai.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.370
So what?

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:12.360
How can you say that?
She might leave the school!

00:07:13.310 --> 00:07:14.750
So what?

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:18.520
I don't care if she has
a miai or gets married.

00:07:19.070 --> 00:07:20.400
If she wants to quit, let her.

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:40.680
Next.

00:07:58.360 --> 00:07:59.630
Look at Hibiki-chan.

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:00.190
Hmm?

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:03.980
She's been like that ever since
that miai offer came up.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.630
She looks completely preoccupied.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.170
She must really be ecstatic.

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:13.690
Next.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:15.250
Please...

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:27.750
What's wrong, Kuzuha?

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:31.360
Nothing.

00:08:45.980 --> 00:08:47.290
Good for her, I say.

00:08:48.260 --> 00:08:50.230
Since he's the Director's nephew it...

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:51.850
should be good for Hibiki-sensei.

00:08:51.850 --> 00:08:53.460
Then you're wrong.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:55.510
Excuse me for saying this...

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:58.280
but Hibiki-sensei is as
pretty as me, right?

00:08:58.560 --> 00:09:00.560
What's so special
about a good-looking...

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:02.720
woman and man becoming a couple?

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:05.090
As pretty as you?

00:09:05.730 --> 00:09:09.450
Therefore, I absolutely object
to Hibiki-sensei's omiai!

00:09:09.930 --> 00:09:12.150
Your objecting isn't
going to change a thing.

00:09:12.530 --> 00:09:15.010
Hibiki-sensei is eager for it.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:16.510
Isn't she?

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:18.130
Of course she is.

00:09:18.980 --> 00:09:23.150
I've known her for a few months now.
You can trust my words.

00:09:23.350 --> 00:09:24.650
That's a short time.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:28.080
Fujio, you can't
trust what this thing says.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:30.750
Hey Ume, you can't call me a "thing"!

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:31.880
Don't call me Ume!

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:33.860
But you know what...

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:38.790
I feel there's something fishy
about that Director's nephew.

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:57.860
We couldn't help
following him, but...

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:00.440
But what are we going to do?

00:10:01.390 --> 00:10:02.330
What's the matter?

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:03.860
Let's go.

00:10:10.140 --> 00:10:11.370
What, are you nervous?

00:10:12.660 --> 00:10:13.470
Shut up.

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.350
Never done something
like this before?

00:10:16.700 --> 00:10:17.700
Shut up, Ume!

00:10:17.880 --> 00:10:19.530
I said don't call me that!

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:22.710
You know...

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:25.040
I've been thinking...

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:25.690
Yes?

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.410
Isn't your last name,
Kasuganomichi, really long?

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.740
Fukae, do you take sugar?

00:10:38.090 --> 00:10:38.850
Do you?

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:52.430
So tomorrow...

00:10:53.820 --> 00:10:54.340
it is.

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:06.720
Damn!

00:11:07.110 --> 00:11:09.160
Why am I a little excited?!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.630
I'm an idiot!

00:11:26.600 --> 00:11:27.610
Fukae?

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:31.620
Thanks!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.570
Enjoy yourselves!

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:34.250
Hey, guys!

00:11:41.060 --> 00:11:42.430
Fukae, are we taking a taxi?

00:11:42.530 --> 00:11:44.430
Just get in, we'll lose him.

00:11:50.380 --> 00:11:52.240
Would you please not
get so close to me?

00:11:52.450 --> 00:11:54.230
It's not by my choice.

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:56.940
You get away from me.

00:11:57.590 --> 00:11:58.980
It is an impossible request.

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:13.440
Really, why do I have to
have a miai with a man?

00:12:19.020 --> 00:12:20.070
But still...

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:23.530
To blow it off,
I'd have to have a reason.

00:12:25.790 --> 00:12:27.690
Like getting into an accident.

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.660
That's Gochiso's...

00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.500
Did he come to see the Bra Man?

00:12:52.090 --> 00:12:53.320
He looks a little shy.

00:12:54.850 --> 00:12:56.900
They must be...

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:57.860
you know?

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:59.190
AYOOOOOOOOO WTF

00:12:58.050 --> 00:12:59.190
That is disgusting.

00:12:59.190 --> 00:13:02.880
That's why he was
wearing a bra!

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:10.240
I knew it!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:13.200
Disgusting. That's disgusting!

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:19.700
I see, so the Director's
nephew's a fruitcake!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:23.010
That means the miai's a sham.

00:13:26.050 --> 00:13:29.350
But then...
I feel sorry for Hibiki-sensei.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:33.260
Deceived by that man's
false pretense...

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:37.010
and if she really falls
in love with him...

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.480
then...

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.180
It's OK, Fuko.

00:13:47.780 --> 00:13:49.390
Let's ruin the omiai.

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.090
Hey, young students.

00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:09.830
Sunday

00:14:11.320 --> 00:14:13.220
It's a good idea, Kochi-san.

00:14:14.560 --> 00:14:17.570
Appealing to that
pretty sensei like this.

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:18.600
Yeah.

00:14:18.930 --> 00:14:21.670
When Hibiki-sensei sees Kochi cleaning these windows...

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.160
she'll forget about marriage.

00:14:26.250 --> 00:14:28.310
Count on your Cupid, here.

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:31.090
Thanks, Mori-chan.

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:41.570
It's not as if you've never
met each other before.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.900
Let's relax and have a good time.

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:55.830
Maybe it's not proper
to confide in a stranger...

00:14:57.110 --> 00:15:00.970
but I have to go
to an omiai tomorrow.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:07.500
But I already have
someone that I adore.

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:10.330
Emi-san.

00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:22.600
But I can't go against
my Uncle's wish.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.080
I owe him a great deal.

00:15:25.560 --> 00:15:26.830
Don't be distressed.

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:31.310
Why don't you just follow what
your heart tells you?

00:15:31.930 --> 00:15:32.440
My heart?

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:35.710
You love Emi-san, don't you?

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.190
Let's start out with the meal.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:44.600
I've had many delicious
dishes arranged.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:54.290
Wow, this is splendid.

00:16:02.220 --> 00:16:05.520
It's common sense to take off such
things when wearing a kimono.

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.890
That's amazing.

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:21.290
Miho, lower your voice.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:28.220
It's impressive, Seiko-chan, ...

00:16:28.660 --> 00:16:31.320
you got a gorgeous room like this on such short notice.

00:16:32.210 --> 00:16:33.740
My father is a stockholder.

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:39.620
But what are we gonna
do to ruin the miai?

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:43.110
Just spying won't
get the job done.

00:16:43.710 --> 00:16:45.680
Don't worry.
Leave it to us.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.980
Excuse me,
Amawa-sensei?

00:16:57.960 --> 00:16:58.760
If I'm eating...

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:01.430
if I have something in my mouth...

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.280
I don't have to speak.

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:06.750
Amawa-sensei, she's speaking to you.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.120
It's perfectly all right.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:11.470
If she likes the food this much...

00:17:11.470 --> 00:17:13.780
then it was worth the
trouble of arranging it.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:20.390
Are you sure it's going to work?

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:21.880
Don't worry.

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.950
If he sees these,
he's going to go bananas.

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:34.890
Seiko-chan!

00:17:35.160 --> 00:17:36.750
What are you doing, Seiko?!

00:17:37.920 --> 00:17:39.110
Water! Water!

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:47.450
It seems they are having
a problem next door.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.610
Yes, I wonder what happened?

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.640
Seiko-chan, hang-on.

00:18:03.620 --> 00:18:04.770
Now what?

00:18:05.260 --> 00:18:08.480
How on earth are we going
to ruin the miai like this?

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.170
Well, you tell me.

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:17.080
What's wrong with you, Yoshio?

00:18:17.300 --> 00:18:19.350
It's not like you at all.

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:22.970
Don't be shy, talk to her
about her hobbies or something.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:28.520
Well...

00:18:32.280 --> 00:18:33.920
What do you like to do?

00:18:38.320 --> 00:18:41.740
Thank you very much,
I now made up my mind.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:45.770
I will go to the miai to save face
with my Uncle, but...

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:50.510
I will firmly decline and
tell him about Emi-san.

00:18:54.440 --> 00:18:55.210
Uncle...

00:18:56.570 --> 00:18:57.330
Everyone...

00:18:57.330 --> 00:18:58.230
please listen.

00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:00.960
To tell the truth...

00:19:11.110 --> 00:19:12.130
I have...

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.770
I already have someone!

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:37.150
Oh, you guys.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.400
Hey Mori-chan...

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:48.120
where do you think
Hibiki-sensei's having the omiai?

00:19:48.280 --> 00:19:49.640
This can't be right.

00:19:50.010 --> 00:19:50.790
True.

00:19:55.680 --> 00:19:56.700
Hibiki-sensei...

00:19:57.560 --> 00:19:58.370
boys and girls...

00:19:59.160 --> 00:20:00.010
how are you all?

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:04.010
I have finally found the courage
to propose to Emi-san...

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:06.790
the girl I have longed for.

00:20:08.670 --> 00:20:10.730
My Uncle has finally
accepted it, as well.

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:13.490
I am such a lucky man.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:16.840
Thank you so much for everything.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:21.450
And?

00:20:21.760 --> 00:20:26.860
Who came up with this courageous
idea to ruin my first omiai?

00:20:28.150 --> 00:20:28.850
Hm?

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:35.980
Kuzuha?

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:38.450
I'm sorry, Sensei.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:40.480
But...

00:20:40.930 --> 00:20:41.650
I...

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:18.090
At the train station after school
that's where I look for you

00:21:11.340 --> 00:21:18.090
Hokago no eki kimi wo sagasu.

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:27.450
With my racing heart
can I find you again today?

00:21:18.200 --> 00:21:27.450
Doki doki shiteru
kyo mo aeru kana?

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:49.410
At this train station
I saw you many times before

00:21:42.620 --> 00:21:49.410
Eki no homu de
mikakete ta kimi.

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:56.300
But couldn't talk to you
Not at all

00:21:49.570 --> 00:21:56.300
Hajime wa nanimo hanase nakatta.

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:03.150
Will I find you again tomorrow?

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:03.150
Moshimo ashita aetara iina?

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:11.130
Maybe I'll have enough
courage to talk to you

00:22:03.290 --> 00:22:11.130
Youki dashite ieru kamone.

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:18.260
Even if the sky cries

00:22:11.320 --> 00:22:18.260
Tatoeba sora ga namida shitemo...

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:27.100
with your smile it's
a sunny day in my eyes

00:22:18.260 --> 00:22:27.100
kimi no egao de hitomi wa hareru yo.

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:53.480
Eighth Period "Rebellious Eyelash-Curler Boys"

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:40.030
Hi everyone, long time no see!

00:22:40.030 --> 00:22:41.750
I'm back to teach "Miho Umeda's Boke

00:22:41.750 --> 00:22:43.610
.. and Tsukkomi Course" properly this time!

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:44.640
Let's go, Seiko!

00:22:44.640 --> 00:22:45.320
Go where?

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:46.970
Already makin' bad jokes!

00:22:46.970 --> 00:22:48.430
Not so, so hot is the hot springs.

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.560
You can't use that old joke, now.

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:52.230
Give it up, already.
